  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>A set of integrated controls allow mentally scaling the power settings of the Monowire’s edge, enabling advanced takedowns.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Monowire Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> Allows the user to initiate a Grab from up to 6m/yds (3 squares) away by wrapping the Monowire around the target. While Grappled in this manner, the Attacker can use the Monowire to Attack the Defender as if this weapon was an Excellent Quality Very Heavy Melee Weapon which cannot be dodged, but cannot use the Choke Action on the target unless they get within regular melee range to hold the target with their hands. Swapping from a monowire grab to a regular grab does not take an Action.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Monowire<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo's required content includes the Edgerunners Mission Kit and Interface RED, and this parent piece comes from there rather than from Cyberpunk RED - Core, which ships no item for it. Make the parent yourself before installing this into it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
